#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"The following creates a configuration extension DDI (confext) for an /etc/"
"motd update:"
msgstr ""
"Folgendes erstellt eine Konfigurationserweiterung DDI (Confext) für eine /"
"etc/motd-Aktualisierung:"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mkdir -p tree/etc/extension-release\\&.d\n"
"echo \"Hello World\" E<gt>tree/etc/motd\n"
"cat E<gt>tree/etc/extension-release\\&.d/extension-release\\&.my-motd E<lt>E<lt>EOF\n"
"ID=fedora\n"
"VERSION_ID=38\n"
"IMAGE_ID=my-motd\n"
"IMAGE_VERSION=7\n"
"EOF\n"
"systemd-repart -C \\e\n"
"  --private-key=privkey\\&.pem \\e\n"
"  --certificate=cert\\&.crt \\e\n"
"  -s tree/ \\e\n"
"  /var/lib/confexts/my-motd\\&.confext\\&.raw\n"
"systemd-confext refresh\n"
msgstr ""
"mkdir -p tree/etc/extension-release\\&.d\n"
"echo \"Hallo Welt\" E<gt>tree/etc/motd\n"
"cat E<gt>tree/etc/extension-release\\&.d/extension-release\\&.my-motd E<lt>E<lt>EOF\n"
"ID=fedora\n"
"VERSION_ID=38\n"
"IMAGE_ID=my-motd\n"
"IMAGE_VERSION=7\n"
"EOF\n"
"systemd-repart -C \\e\n"
"  --private-key=privkey\\&.pem \\e\n"
"  --certificate=cert\\&.crt \\e\n"
"  -s tree/ \\e\n"
"  /var/lib/confexts/my-motd\\&.confext\\&.raw\n"
"systemd-confext refresh\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"The DDI generated that way may be applied to the system with B<systemd-"
"confext>(1)\\&."
msgstr ""
"Die auf diese Art erstellte DDI kann auf das System mit B<systemd-"
"confext>(1) angewandt werden\\&."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
msgid ""
"B<Example\\ \\&2.\\ \\&Generate a system extension image and sign it via "
"PKCS11>"
msgstr ""
"B<Beispiel\\ \\&1.\\ \\&Erstellen eines Systemerweiterungsabbilds und "
"Signieren mittels PKCS11>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-rawhide
msgid ""
"The following creates a system extension DDI (sysext) for an /usr/foo update "
"and signs it with a hardware token via PKCS11:"
msgstr ""
"Folgendes erstellt eine Systemerweiterung DDI (Sysext) für eine /usr/foo-"
"Aktualisierung und signiert sie mit einem Hardware-Token mittels PKCS11:"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mkdir -p tree/usr/lib/extension-release\\&.d\n"
"echo \"Hello World\" E<gt>tree/usr/foo\n"
"cat E<gt>tree/usr/lib/extension-release\\&.d/extension-release\\&.my-foo E<lt>E<lt>EOF\n"
"ID=fedora\n"
"VERSION_ID=38\n"
"IMAGE_ID=my-foo\n"
"IMAGE_VERSION=7\n"
"EOF\n"
"systemd-repart --make-ddi=sysext \\e\n"
"  --private-key-source=engine:pkcs11 \\e\n"
"  --private-key=\"pkcs11:model=PKCS%2315%20emulated;manufacturer=piv_II;serial=0123456789abcdef;token=Some%20Cert\" \\e\n"
"  --certificate=cert\\&.crt \\e\n"
"  -s tree/ \\e\n"
"  /var/lib/extensions/my-foo\\&.sysext\\&.raw\n"
"systemd-sysext refresh\n"
msgstr ""
"mkdir -p tree/usr/lib/extension-release\\&.d\n"
"echo \"Hallo Welt\" E<gt>tree/usr/foo\n"
"cat E<gt>tree/usr/lib/extension-release\\&.d/extension-release\\&.my-foo E<lt>E<lt>EOF\n"
"ID=fedora\n"
"VERSION_ID=38\n"
"IMAGE_ID=my-foo\n"
"IMAGE_VERSION=7\n"
"EOF\n"
"systemd-repart --make-ddi=sysext \\e\n"
"  --private-key-source=engine:pkcs11 \\e\n"
"  --private-key=\"pkcs11:model=PKCS%2315%20emulated;manufacturer=piv_II;serial=0123456789abcdef;token=Some%20Cert\" \\e\n"
"  --certificate=cert\\&.crt \\e\n"
"  -s tree/ \\e\n"
"  /var/lib/extensions/my-foo\\&.sysext\\&.raw\n"
"systemd-sysext refresh\n"

#. type: Plain text
